node_modules/
seed/serviceAccountKey.json
# seed/source/*.xlsx was ignored until 23-Oct-26, and that cost a week and a
# half. build_seed.py reads those workbooks, so with them untracked every
# machine built from whatever copy it happened to hold - and nothing in the
# output said which. Ayush's DCR was three weeks behind mine; his build wrote
# Rs 3.99 Cr to Firestore, I was quoting Rs 4.45 Cr from the same script, and
# the dashboard read zero for October while both of us believed the data was
# loaded. The input to a build belongs in the repo with the build.
# Derived copies stay out: build_seed.py regenerates them.
seed/source/*.clean.xlsx
seed/out/
.firebase/
*.log
public/build.json
